From: flange <flange@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] iwlwifi: pcie: 非一致性 DMA 平台读取 RB 前同步缓存

iwl_pcie_rx_handle_rb() 在 dma_unmap_page() 之前就解析 RB 内容；iwlmld 开启
rx_mpdu_no_unmap 后，MPDU 全程不 unmap 也不 sync。x86 DMA 与缓存硬件一致，
不受影响；arm64 Rockchip PCIe 为非一致性 DMA，CPU 读到缓存中的陈旧数据，
触发 "frame on invalid queue" WARN 并丢帧，接收吞吐跌到几十 Mbit/s。

读取前 dma_sync_single_for_cpu()，保持映射复用时交还设备前
dma_sync_single_for_device()；一致性平台上二者近似空操作。
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/pcie/gen1_2/rx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/pcie/gen1_2/rx.c
@@ -1310,6 +1310,15 @@
 	if (WARN_ON(!rxb))
 		return;
 
+	/*
+	 * The RB is still DMA-mapped here and is read before (or, with
+	 * rx_mpdu_no_unmap, entirely without) dma_unmap_page(). On
+	 * non-coherent platforms (e.g. arm64 Rockchip PCIe) the CPU must
+	 * invalidate its cache first, or it parses stale data.
+	 */
+	dma_sync_single_for_cpu(trans->dev, rxb->page_dma, max_len,
+				DMA_FROM_DEVICE);
+
 	while (offset + sizeof(u32) + sizeof(struct iwl_cmd_header) < max_len) {
 		struct iwl_rx_packet *pkt;
 		struct iwl_cmd_header hdr;
@@ -1456,6 +1465,10 @@
 				rxb->page = NULL;
 				goto reuse_without_page;
 			}
+		} else {
+			/* still mapped: hand the buffer back to the device */
+			dma_sync_single_for_device(trans->dev, rxb->page_dma,
+						   max_len, DMA_FROM_DEVICE);
 		}
 
 		list_add_tail(&rxb->list, &rxq->rx_free);
